<p>Surround yourself with a phantasmal shield of pure light.</p><p>Whenever you would take damage there is <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">13%, 16%, 19%, 21%, 22%</acronym> chance to become ethereal for an instant and fully ignore it.</p><p>If you do get hit, the shield glows brightly, sending triggering a flash of light on the attacker, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> light damage in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> around it and dazzling any affected creature (deal 10% less damage) for 5 turns. This can only happen every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 13, 11, 10, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage and ignore chance will increase with your Spellpower.</p>